# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# iCloud Drive sync-conflict copies. This repo lives under ~/Documents (iCloud-synced);
# iCloud mints "<name> 2.<ext>" copies on conflicts (e.g. GitHub Desktop branch switches
# racing the sync), and `git add -A` will silently ingest them. This pattern keeps the
# file-level copies out. If you ever need a legitimately-named "... 2.md" file, add it
# with `git add -f`. (We deliberately do NOT guard extensionless "<name> 2" — that would
# also swallow legitimately-named directories like "Draft 2/".)
* [0-9].*

# Python bytecode cache (e.g. TOOLS/__pycache__ from importing lore_validate in lore_build_manifest).
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# LORE workbench — runtime state lives in ~/.lore (or $LORE_HOME), not the repo.
# Guard only against a stray repo-local .lore/. Do NOT ignore *.asc: detached
# signatures (KEYS/*.asc, INTAKE/RAW-MANIFEST.sha256.asc, author-only artifact
# signatures) are tracked and central to the signing workflow.
/.lore/

# Python bytecode (workbench tools)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
